-    *   $\mathbf{d} = (d_x, d_y, d_z)$: Viewing direction vector.
-*   **Outputs**:
-    *   $\sigma$: Volume density.
-    *   $\mathbf{c}$: View-dependent color (RGB).
-    *   $\nu$: Predicted variance (uncertainty) of the color/density prediction.
